   "data": {
    "text": "AUDIO MIX\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 9, CC 81 to 92\n   1 Music under speech\n   2 Audio fades\n   3 Voice effect\n   4 Edited-in sound hits\n   5 Loudness\n   6 Voice-over\n   7 Translated voice\n   8 Voice cleanup\n   9 pair: When the joke pays off, a sound hit lands\n  10 pair: When the clip slows down, the music rises\n  11 pair: When the clip rewinds, a sound hit plays\n  12 pair: When a cutaway covers the talking, the music sits under"
   },
